# Subagent orchestration

Do not spawn or delegate to any subagent unless the user explicitly requests
a named subagent in the current message.

In particular:

- skills must execute in the current parent agent by default;
- do not invoke reviewers, critics, explorers, or general-purpose subagents
  automatically;
- do not launch independent reviews after completing a skill;
- do not launch multiple or parallel subagents unless explicitly requested;
- if a subagent would be useful, report that recommendation and stop rather
  than launching it.

The user is the orchestrator of subagent execution.